@startuml

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 0
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor white
  BorderColor black
}

actor "Customer" as User
participant "BookingPage" as UI
participant "App.jsx" as App
participant "FieldOperationController" as Controller
participant "FieldOperationService" as Service
participant "SlotGenerationService" as Generator
participant "SystemSetting / Field / Slot Repositories" as Repo
database "Database" as DB

== UC-13: Search Available Fields by Date and Type ==

User -> UI : 1. Choose date and field type
activate User
activate UI

UI -> App : 2. loadSlots()
activate App

App -> App : 3. Validate UI state and build request
activate App
deactivate App

App -> Controller : 4. GET /api/slots/search?date&fieldTypeId
activate Controller

Controller -> Service : 5. searchSlots(date, fieldTypeId)
activate Service

alt Request is valid and authorized
  Service -> Generator : 6. ensureDate(targetDate)
  activate Generator
  Generator -> Repo : 7. Load generation rules,\nactive fields and existing slots
  activate Repo

  Repo -> DB : 8. SELECT system_setting, field and slot
  activate DB
  DB --> Repo : 9. Rules and current calendar rows
  deactivate DB

  Repo --> Generator : 10. Repository result
  deactivate Repo

  Generator -> Repo : 11. saveAll(missing available slots)
  activate Repo
  Repo -> DB : 12. INSERT non-overlapping generated slots
  activate DB
  DB --> Repo : 13. Persisted rows
  deactivate DB
  Repo --> Generator : 14. Created count
  deactivate Repo
  Generator --> Service : 15. Date materialized
  deactivate Generator

  Service -> Repo : 16. findBySlotDate; check active bookings
  activate Repo
  Repo -> DB : 17. SELECT slots and booking state
  activate DB
  DB --> Repo : 18. Slots with reservation flags
  deactivate DB
  Repo --> Service : 19. Repository result
  deactivate Repo

  Service -> Service : 20. Filter type; calculate price\nand available flag
  activate Service
  deactivate Service
else Validation, authorization, or state rule fails
  note over Service,Controller
    API failure -> no search results and error notice
    The service propagates ApiException to ApiExceptionHandler.
  end note
end

Service --> Controller : 21. Domain result or propagated error
deactivate Service

Controller -> Controller : 22. Serialize response
activate Controller
deactivate Controller

Controller --> App : 23. HTTP 200 or mapped 4xx\nresponse body or error payload
deactivate Controller

App -> App : 24. setSlots(response.data)
activate App
deactivate App

App --> UI : 25. Render matching slot list
deactivate App

UI --> User : 26. Updated screen or error feedback

deactivate UI
deactivate User

@enduml
